{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Build a premium, responsive **Shopify collection product grid** for KAPISA.
    
    This is the **actual collection product grid**. Do NOT create a featured-products section, product picker, filter section, sorting toolbar, sidebar, or manually selected products.
    
    ### Core Requirement
    
    Automatically render products from the **current Shopify collection using `collection.products`**.
    
    Every Kapisa collection should automatically display its own products. Do not hardcode product names, handles, prices, images, colors, or product data.
    
    The grid must work with Shopify's native collection data and pagination.
    
    ### Product Grid
    
    * 4 columns desktop
    * 3 columns tablet
    * 2 columns mobile
    * ~20px desktop gap
    * ~12px mobile gap
    * Full-width spacious editorial layout
    * Off-white background `#FAF7F0`
    
    ### Product Cards
    
    Use the existing KAPISA product-card styling consistently.
    
    * 4:5 product image area
    * Background `#F0EEE9`
    * `object-fit: cover`
    * Never stretch or distort images
    * Use the first product image automatically
    * Use the second product image for desktop hover when available
    * Smooth, subtle image crossfade
    * Small refined gold `Bestseller` / `New` badge when applicable
    * Minimal charcoal wishlist/heart button
    * Wishlist active state becomes gold
    * Desktop hover: subtle gold `Quick Add` control sliding upward from the bottom of the image
    * Disable or simplify hover interactions on touch devices
    
    ### Product Information
    
    Below each image:
    
    * Product title: charcoal `#2B2B2E`, 14px, medium/bold
    * Maximum 2 lines with clean text clamping
    * Price: navy `#0E1F3C`
    * Compare-at price: slate `#8FA3B8`, struck through
    * Dynamically display real Shopify product colors/swatches when available
    * Maximum 5 visible swatches with `+N` for additional colors
    * Use the existing KAPISA swatch styling
    * Use flexbox for consistent alignment
    * Never allow text or content to overflow
    
    Do not use awkward fixed card heights. Keep the image ratio consistent and let the product information align naturally.
    
    ### Loading More Products
    
    At the bottom of the grid, add a simple **Load More** button.
    
    * Use Shopify's native collection pagination/data
    * Initially display the normal collection page size
    * Clicking **Load More** progressively loads the next products
    * No numbered pagination
    * No filter or sorting controls
    * No extra collection controls
    * Keep the interaction lightweight and fast
    * If there are no more products, hide the button
    * Preserve the current collection and Shopify pagination state correctly
    
    ### Visual Direction
    
    Make it feel like a premium medical-fashion ecommerce store, not a generic Shopify/Dawn collection page.
    
    Use:
    
    * Off-white `#FAF7F0`
    * Charcoal `#2B2B2E`
    * Navy `#0E1F3C`
    * Gold `#C9A227`
    * Slate `#8FA3B8`
    
    Use generous whitespace, clean typography, subtle borders and restrained gold accents.
    
    Avoid:
    
    * Filter sections
    * Sort dropdowns
    * Filter sidebars
    * Product pickers
    * Featured-product logic
    * Manually selected products
    * Heavy shadows
    * Excessive rounded cards
    * Gradients
    * Bulky UI
    * Generic Dawn styling
    
    **Most important:** this must be a simple, real Shopify collection grid powered by `collection.products`. Automatically show the products belonging to whichever collection/page the customer is viewing, followed only by a clean **Load More** button.
    , remove the wishlist button from the card and on hover white background is showing in the card fix it either make it little zoom on hover , Create an empty-state message that displays inside the product grid area when no products match the selected filters, off-white 
    #FAF7F0 background, centered content. A simple line-icon (e.g. a search or empty-box icon) in slate 
    #8FA3B8, 48px, centered. Below it, text 'No products match your filters' in bold charcoal 
    #2B2B2E, and a smaller line below in slate suggesting 'Try adjusting your filters.' A gold 
    #C9A227 outline 'Clear All Filters' button centered below the text. Keep generous vertical padding (80px top and bottom) so this state doesn't look cramped when it replaces the grid.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:#FAF7F0;color:#2B2B2E;padding:32px 20px 56px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1600px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:42px 20px}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}{min-width:0}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;background:#F0EEE9}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image,.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__hover-image{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 320ms ease,opacity 280ms ease}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__hover-image{opacity:0}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{transform:scale(1.035)}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__hover-image{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.035)}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;z-index:2;padding:5px 8px;background:#C9A227;color:#2B2B2E;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quick-add{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;left:12px;z-index:2;padding:11px 14px;border:0;background:#0E1F3C;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 220ms ease,transform 220ms ease}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quick-add{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info{padding-top:13px}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{display:-webkit-box;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 6px;color:#2B2B2E;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:2}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;color:#0E1F3C;font-size:14px}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{color:#8FA3B8;text-decoration:line-through}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__swatches{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:10px}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__swatch{width:13px;height:13px;border:1px solid rgba(43,43,46,.35);border-radius:50%}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more{color:#8FA3B8;font-size:11px;line-height:13px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:52px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more{padding:13px 28px;border:1px solid #0E1F3C;background:transparent;color:#0E1F3C;font:inherit;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more[hidden]{display:none}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:360px;padding:80px 20px;text-align:center}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-icon{width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:24px;color:#8FA3B8}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-icon svg{display:block;width:48px;height:48px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:1.5}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-title{margin:0;color:#2B2B2E;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-text{margin:8px 0 24px;color:#8FA3B8;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__clear{padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid #C9A227;background:transparent;color:#2B2B2E;font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;cursor:pointer}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__clear:hover{background:#C9A227}@media(max-width:989px){.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:749px){.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:24px 12px 44px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{width:100%;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px 12px}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quick-add{display:none}.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{top:8px;left:8px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{min-height:300px;padding:80px 12px}.kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-title{font-size:17px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image,.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__hover-image,.kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quick-add{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<kapisa-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }} data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  {% paginate collection.products by block.settings.products_per_page %}
    {% if collection.products_count == 0 %}
      <div class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty" data-empty-state>
        <div class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="12"></circle><path d="m30 30 9 9M16 21h10"></path></svg></div>
        <h2 class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-title">No products match your filters</h2>
        <p class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-text">Try adjusting your filters.</p>
        <a class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__clear" href="{{ collection.url }}">Clear All Filters</a>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid" data-grid>
        {% for product in collection.products %}
          {% assign first_image=product.images | first %}{% assign second_image=product.images[1] %}{% assign badge=blank %}{% if product.tags contains 'Bestseller' or product.tags contains 'bestseller' %}{% assign badge='Bestseller' %}{% elsif product.tags contains 'New' or product.tags contains 'new' %}{% assign badge='New' %}{% endif %}
          <article class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media"><a href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">{% if first_image %}<img class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image" src="{{ first_image | image_url: width:900 }}" alt="{{ first_image.alt | default:product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1125">{% else %}<div class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}{% if second_image %}<img class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__hover-image" src="{{ second_image | image_url: width:900 }}" alt="{{ second_image.alt | default:product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1125">{% endif %}</a>{% if badge != blank %}<span class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ badge }}</span>{% endif %}{% if product.available %}<form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quick-add" type="submit">Quick add</button></form>{% endif %}</div><div class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info"><h2 class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h2><div class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price"><span>{{ product.price | money }}</span>{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% for option in product.options_with_values %}{% assign option_name=option.name | downcase %}{% if option_name contains 'color' or option_name contains 'colour' %}<div class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__swatches" aria-label="Available colors">{% for value in option.values limit:5 %}<span class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__swatch" title="{{ value | escape }}" style="background-color:{{ value | escape }};"></span>{% endfor %}{% if option.values.size > 5 %}<span class="kapisa-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more">+{{ option.values.size | minus:5 }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% assign has_next=paginate.next %}
  {% endpaginate %}
  <div class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more-wrap"><button class="kapisa-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}__more" type="button" data-load-more {% unless has_next %}hidden{% endunless %}>Load more</button></div>
</kapisa-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){class KapisaCollectionGrid{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.grid=this.querySelector('[data-grid]');this.button=this.querySelector('[data-load-more]');this.page=1;if(this.button)this.button.addEventListener('click',()=>this.loadMore())}async loadMore(){if(!this.grid||this.button.disabled)return;this.button.disabled=true;const url=new URL(window.location.href);url.searchParams.set('page',this.page+1);url.searchParams.set('section_id',this.dataset.sectionId);try{const response=await fetch(url);const parsed=new DOMParser().parseFromString(await response.text(),'text/html');const nextGrid=parsed.querySelector('[data-grid]');if(!nextGrid||!nextGrid.children.length){this.button.hidden=true;return}Array.from(nextGrid.children).forEach(card=>this.grid.appendChild(card));this.page++;const nextButton=parsed.querySelector('[data-load-more]');if(!nextButton||nextButton.hasAttribute('hidden'))this.button.hidden=true}catch(error){}finally{this.button.disabled=false}}}if(!customElements.get('kapisa-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}'))customElements.define('kapisa-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}',KapisaCollectionGrid{{ ai_gen_id }})})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Kapisa collection grid","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"products_per_page","label":"Products per page","min":4,"max":40,"step":4,"default":16},{"type":"paragraph","content":"Products are loaded automatically from the current collection."}],"presets":[{"name":"Kapisa collection grid"}],"tag":null,"class":"kapisa-collection-grid-block"}{% endschema %}